*> vybe-test: cobol/qualified_names_of_clause/qualified_of_clause_basic
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_qualified_names_of_clause.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 GRP-A.
   05 CODE PIC X(3) VALUE "AAA".
01 GRP-B.
   05 CODE PIC X(3) VALUE "BBB".
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY CODE OF GRP-A.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING CODE OF GRP-A DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "AAA"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [AAA] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY CODE OF GRP-B.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING CODE OF GRP-B DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "BBB"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [BBB] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

